@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"当时<br>还在下雨呢，<br><br><link=\"Objection_02_02_06_01\">怎么可能做得了直播</link>呀！？|#0202Trial06_Hanna001|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Eyes01>Eyes01_Angry_Closed,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Cry_Open,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Sweat01>Sweat01_01
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Hanna Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
