@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:杀人现场是<br>焚烧炉室，<br>这个说法只是<br>一个假设而已……|#0202Trial06_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

